TI  - Digital Transformation and Innovation Management in Financial Services: A Strategic Approach for Latin America
AU  - Taj-Taj, José Ignacio
AB  - Digital transformation has become a central component of the strategy of financial organizations globally. In Latin America, this trend has been accelerated by the disruption generated by fintechs, the digitalization of consumer habits, and the need to reduce operational costs in challenging macroeconomic environments. According to ECLAC (2023), more than 60% of financial institutions in Latin America have initiated formal digital transformation processes, although only 28% have reached advanced levels of digital maturity.
